  "solution": {
    "text": "Differentiating using Leibnitz rule, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Putting <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>"
